' 17 Legacy charges of a space transaction (decision 45, Option P): the host
' program, the space transaction of the same operations, and a stop at a
' pre-charge.
'
' The former Figure N10 of ../design.md. Decision 90 retired the legacy charges
' and that figure of the design. The figure restates the host charges
' of storage/charging_rspace.rs (a pre-charge before the host call, then the
' post-charges of handle_result) and the chain of
' rholang/src/rust/interpreter/reified/legacy_charges.rs. It adds no new fact.
'
' Reading order, from the top to the bottom:
'   1. The host program: the reducer registers the authority of each
'      operation, and ChargingRSpace charges its pre-charge, runs the
'      operation, and charges its post-charges.
'   2. The space transaction: the agent stages each operation through the
'      chain, which puts the carried post-charges, the registration and the
'      pre-charge into the callback of the operation. The commit runs the
'      callbacks, and finish charges the last post-charges after the commit.
'      The legacy log equals the log of the host program.
'   3. A pre-charge that runs out of phlo stops the commit before its
'      operation, where the host program stops.
'
' Colors come from concept-colors.iuml (aliases of the shared palette).
' Render: ./render.sh 17-legacy-charge-chain.puml   Check: ./render.sh --check

@startuml 17-legacy-charge-chain
!include ../../../casper/theory/diagrams/palette.iuml
!include concept-colors.iuml
$ca_base_skin()
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor $rrs_relation
  LifeLineBorderColor $rrs_relation
  ParticipantBorderColor $rrs_relation
  ActorBorderColor $rrs_relation
  GroupBorderColor $rrs_relation
  DividerBorderColor $rrs_relation
  DividerBackgroundColor $ca_note_grey
}
skinparam CollectionsBorderColor $rrs_relation
skinparam NoteBorderColor $rrs_relation
skinparam LegendBorderColor $rrs_relation
skinparam LegendBackgroundColor $ca_note_grey
title Legacy charges of a space transaction (decision 45, Option P)
autonumber

participant "Reducer" as RED $rrs_host
participant "ChargingRSpace" as CHG $rrs_host
participant "Space agent\n(P4)" as AGENT $rrs_agent
participant "LegacyChain" as CHAIN $rrs_agent
participant "SpaceTxn\ncommit (P1)" as TXN $rrs_substrate
collections "Legacy budget\nand its log" as BUD $rrs_host

== The host program: operations 0 and 1 ==
RED -[$rrs_flow]> BUD : register the authority of op 0
RED -[$rrs_flow]> CHG : host call of op 0
CHG -[$rrs_effect]> BUD : <latex>\mathrm{pre}_0</latex>
CHG -[$rrs_relation]> CHG : the RSpace operation:\nobserver calls and events
CHG -[$rrs_effect]> BUD : <latex>\mathrm{post}_0</latex>: refunds and event fees
RED -[$rrs_flow]> BUD : register the authority of op 1
RED -[$rrs_flow]> CHG : host call of op 1
CHG -[$rrs_effect]> BUD : <latex>\mathrm{pre}_1</latex>
CHG -[$rrs_relation]> CHG : the RSpace operation
CHG -[$rrs_effect]> BUD : <latex>\mathrm{post}_1</latex>

== The space transaction of the same operations ==
AGENT -[$rrs_flow]> CHAIN : stage op 0 (the charges come from the staged op)
CHAIN -[$rrs_relation]> CHAIN : callback 0: register, <latex>\mathrm{pre}_0</latex>\ncarry <latex>\mathrm{post}_0</latex>
AGENT -[$rrs_flow]> CHAIN : stage op 1
CHAIN -[$rrs_relation]> CHAIN : callback 1: <latex>\mathrm{post}_0</latex>, register, <latex>\mathrm{pre}_1</latex>\ncarry <latex>\mathrm{post}_1</latex>
AGENT -[$rrs_flow]> TXN : commit()
TXN -[$rrs_effect]> BUD : callback 0: register, <latex>\mathrm{pre}_0</latex>
TXN -[$rrs_relation]> TXN : op 0: observer calls and events
TXN -[$rrs_effect]> BUD : callback 1: <latex>\mathrm{post}_0</latex>, register, <latex>\mathrm{pre}_1</latex>
TXN -[$rrs_relation]> TXN : op 1: observer calls and events
AGENT -[$rrs_flow]> CHAIN : finish(), after the commit
CHAIN -[$rrs_effect]> BUD : the tail: <latex>\mathrm{post}_1</latex>
note over BUD : one log in both runs:\n<latex>\mathrm{pre}_0, \mathrm{post}_0, \mathrm{pre}_1, \mathrm{post}_1</latex>

== Out of phlo at the pre-charge of op 1 ==
TXN -[$rrs_effect]> BUD : callback 1: <latex>\mathrm{post}_0</latex>, register, <latex>\mathrm{pre}_1</latex>
BUD -[$rrs_fail]-> TXN : OutOfPhlogistonsError
TXN -[$rrs_fail]-> AGENT : op 0 stays applied, and op 1\nmakes no observer call (D6)
note over RED, CHG : the host program stops at <latex>\mathrm{pre}_1</latex>,\nbefore the host call of op 1: the same point

legend bottom
**Concept colors**
|<$rrs_host>       | host at the baseline: reducer, ChargingRSpace, budget |
|<$rrs_agent>      | space agent and its legacy chain (P4, decision 45) |
|<$rrs_substrate>  | substrate of P1: the commit of the space transaction |
**Arrows**
|<$rrs_flow>       | call |
|<$rrs_effect>     | charge on the legacy budget |
|<$rrs_relation>   | internal step |
|<$rrs_fail>       | failure |
endlegend
@enduml
